VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t08
GOAL
  Port parsing works and stays panic-free.
CLAIM valid-port REQUIRED
  ENSURE parse_port("8080") returns Ok(8080)
CLAIM invalid-port REQUIRED
  ENSURE a non-numeric or out-of-range port returns Err instead of panicking
INVARIANT no-unwrap CRITICAL
  ENSURE library code contains no unwrap() call
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY valid-port
  USING mini.t.port.valid
VERIFY invalid-port
  USING mini.t.port.invalid
VERIFY no-unwrap
  USING mini.no.unwrap
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
